note In the Listing, click a line and shift-click another to select lines, then press 'pin selection' in the top bar: the lines become a new step of the path being read, authored by the human, placed under the selected step (or at the top level when none is selected) and anchored to the symbol that contains them. The status bar says where it went. Without a line selection in the Listing, or without a path being read, the status bar says what is missing and nothing changes.

